{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eb2ab388-f99e-8971-8dd5-fce82b116213",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:31:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Greg, Walter Lawton here. I'm on speaker, I've got my hands full, so tell me if I'm breaking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're coming through okay. What can I do for you, Walter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:26:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So basically I'm putting in a pool this spring, and I want to get the barrier stuff right before I order anything. What are the rules on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:26:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it in-ground or above-ground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:26:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In-ground. Basically a rectangle, about sixteen by thirty-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. In general, a pool has to be enclosed by a barrier, and there are requirements on height and on the gate. The gate usually has to be self-closing and self-latching. The pool itself will need a permit too, so you'll be dealing with us on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that part I figured. The fence is what I'm asking about. I'm planning chain-link, five feet tall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:27:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chain-link is common for that. Five feet is a pretty typical height. The mesh size matters, though, because the openings can't be big enough for a kid to climb or squeeze through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] So does the fence itself need a permit, or is it just a call to the city to let you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A fence around a pool, yes, you'll want a permit. It's not just a phone call. Fences in general usually need one, and a pool barrier gets looked at as part of the pool inspection. Most people file them together."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So one application, basically, for the pool and the fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually you'd show the fence on the site plan with the pool. If the contractor is handling it, they'll often put it all in one package. If you're doing it yourself, you can come in or send it over and we'll walk through what's needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm doing the fence myself, the pool is going to a contractor. Okay. Next question. How close to the property line can the fence go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:28:40-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There are setback rules for the pool itself, and fences have their own placement rules. I don't want to give you a number off the top of my head that turns out wrong for your lot. It can also depend on the zoning district. Do you know what zone you're in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:29:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No idea, honestly. [pause] Is that something I can look up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The city has a zoning map online, and if you give us your address we can tell you the district. Once we know that, the setbacks are straightforward. You'd also want to find your actual survey line, because the fence has to be on your side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I have a plot plan from when I bought the house. That should show it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That helps a lot. Bring it in or scan it and send it. A lot of people also set the fence a little inside the line so there's no argument with a neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense. And I'd rather not say my address on a speaker call, so I'll just come by in person with the plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Counter's open weekdays. Someone here can pull the zone and go over the setbacks with you while you're standing there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Last thing, can you spell your last name for me? I want to write down who I talked to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's Lombardi. L-O-M-B-A-R-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "L-O-M-B-A-R-D-I. Got it. And it's Greg, first name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Ask for me or whoever's at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. If I need to reach you, my number is 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0155. I'll jot it down, but honestly just come in with the plot plan and the pool drawings if you have them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. The contractor should have drawings by next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Bring those and a sketch of where the fence runs, with the gate location marked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gate location, plot plan, pool drawings. That's everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that covers it. Thanks, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
